## Router downgrade context-size gate

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | ---- |
| Large-context "automation" requests (160k-800k tokens) downgraded to glm-4.7 take 20-45s each, serializing through 2-slot lane, while deepseek-v4-flash completes in ~2s | Router downgrades all "automation" class requests to glm-4.7 regardless of context size; glm-4.7's 2-slot plan concurrency + slow long-context prefill destroy performance | Add context-size gate (`downgradeMaxContextChars = 100_000`); skip downgrade when request payload exceeds threshold and log `subagent_router: downgrade skipped — context too large` |

