| Cannot verify whether glm-4.7 downgrade lane overflow is firing correctly or if requests are unnecessarily waiting for slots | Channel doesn't expose current buffer depth; no visibility into in-flight count | Add `atomic.Int64` counter `glm47LaneInUse` alongside semaphore; log `in_use`/`capacity` on every routing decision in `selectDowngradeLane` |

